      "message": "test(post): pin the G-EDM rapid refusal and compile after main\n\n- crates/app/tests/g_edm_post.rs: add `sharp_corners: false` to the\n  WireContourOp (main added the field in #3207).\n- New pin g_edm_refuses_a_rapid_with_the_wire_threaded_by_name: a rapid\n  between two cuts refuses by name, and no cut follows it.\n- assets/posts/AGENTS.md: g-edm.cps is now the fourth WIRE_POSTS entry\n  (after the Agie native post from main).\n\nRefs #2700\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
